		   kept invisible but still laid out, so it can be measured. The script sets data-ready on the nav when done.
		   Scoped to html[data-js] so the TOC can never stay hidden when scripts don't run, and skipped while the
		   sidebar is collapsed (it is already hidden then, and its peek rules must win). */
		/* DISABLED: the sidebar now shows immediately. Uncomment to hide it until the script has measured.
		html[data-js]:not([data-toc-collapsed]) .right-sidebar:has(.api-toc:not([data-ready])) {
